  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Waste 2025 &#x2013; UNHCR Waste Management Officer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The request for deployment is part of UNHCR&#x2019;s waste management programme, developing supply-related strategies for UNHCR refugee camps. The project contributes to the programme by assessing and analysing the way UNHCR&#x2019;s supply activities (distribution, storage, maintenance, consumption) create waste, through a combination of remote study and field missions. Once the deployment is finished, the final deliverables will be used within the UNHCR&#x2019;s waste management programme to further develop tools for tailored guidance around waste management, and work towards mitigating environmental degradation and minimising the environmental footprint of humanitarian assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
